{"id": "27d8b7bc-0618-44d7-aa8a-a822adba7459", "slug": "nexus-semantic-search", "title": "Nexus - Semantic Search", "description": "Nexus Semantic Background Effect is designed for delivering a visual treatment or immersive background effect. Key features include atmospheric visuals, motion depth, and flexible presentation layering. It is suitable for visual-first pages, motion studies, and atmospheric hero treatments.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-staff-featured-2026-05-22\"\nname: \"Nexus - Semantic Search\"\ndescription: \"Nexus Semantic Background Effect is designed for delivering a visual treatment or immersive background effect. Key features include atmospheric visuals, motion depth, and flexible presentation layering. It is suitable for visual-first pages, motion studies, and atmospheric hero treatments.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#74E7E0\"\n  secondary: \"#E7FF72\"\n  accent: \"#E7FF72\"\n  background: \"#E7FF72\"\n  surface: \"#F4F0E8\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#626A67\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Geist\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Geist Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Geist Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"16px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Nexus - Semantic Search\nSource: Neuform staff featured templates. Author: Samnang Aing (@samnang). Views: 29; favorites: 4; remixes: 0.\nTags: background, animated, webgl, threejs, dither, effect.\n## Overview\nNexus Semantic Background Effect is designed for delivering a visual treatment or immersive background effect. Key features include atmospheric visuals, motion depth, and flexible presentation layering. It is suitable for visual-first pages, motion studies, and atmospheric hero treatments.\n\nNexus Platform Architecture Metrics Logs Semantic discovery powered by intent Embed ultra-fast, context-aware search into your architecture with our laser-focused semantic API. Initialize System\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Semantic discovery powered by intent.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #74E7E0, secondary #E7FF72, accent #E7FF72, background #E7FF72, surface #F4F0E8, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Geist for display moments and Geist Mono for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use Geist Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"scroll-smooth\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Nexus - Semantic Search</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Geist:wght@400;500;600&family=Geist+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n\n    <style>\n        :root {\n            --void: #050608;\n            --surface: #0A0D10;\n            --surface-soft: #10151A;\n            --text: #F4F0E8;\n            --muted: #9EA3A0;\n            --dim: #626A67;\n            --signal: #E7FF72;\n            --cyan: #74E7E0;\n            --ember: #FF8764;\n            --line: rgba(244, 240, 232, 0.10);\n        }\n\n        body {\n            font-family: 'Geist', sans-serif;\n            background:\n                radial-gradient(circle at 50% 42%, rgba(116, 231, 224, 0.06), transparent 30%),\n                radial-gradient(circle at 75% 72%, rgba(231, 255, 114, 0.06), transparent 26%),\n                var(--void);\n        }\n\n        .font-mono-custom {\n            font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace;\n        }\n\n        .nav-shell {\n            box-shadow:\n                0 18px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45),\n                inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);\n        }\n\n        .headline-mask {\n            display: block;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            padding-bottom: 0.08em;\n        }\n\n        .headline-line {\n            display: block;\n            transform: translateY(118%) rotate(1.2deg);\n            transform-origin: left bottom;\n            will-change: transform;\n        }\n\n        .hero-copy,\n        .hero-cta {\n            opacity: 0;\n            transform: translateY(14px);\n        }\n\n        .nav-reveal {\n            opacity: 0;\n            transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(14px);\n        }\n\n        .text-gradient {\n            background:\n                linear-gradient(90deg,\n                    var(--text) 0%,\n                    var(--cyan) 48%,\n                    var(--signal) 100%\n                );\n            -webkit-background-clip: text;\n            background-clip: text;\n            color: transparent;\n        }\n\n        .hero-aura {\n            position: absolute;\n            inset: -22%;\n            background:\n                radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, rgba(116,231,224,0.10), transparent 34%),\n                radial-gradient(circle at 45% 52%, rgba(231,255,114,0.07), transparent 26%),\n                radial-gradient(circle at 62% 45%, rgba(255,135,100,0.045), transparent 24%);\n            filter: blur(24px);\n            opacity: 0.9;\n            pointer-events: none;\n        }\n\n        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n            .headline-line,\n            .hero-copy,\n            .hero-cta {\n                transform: none !important;\n                opacity: 1 !important;\n            }\n\n            .nav-reveal {\n                transform: translateX(-50%) !important;\n                opacity: 1 !important;\n            }\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n\n<body class=\"bg-[var(--void)] text-[var(--muted)] antialiased overflow-x-hidden selection:bg-[var(--signal)]/20\">\n\n    <!-- Background Faint Grid Lines -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none flex justify-between px-8 sm:px-24 opacity-25\">\n        <div class=\"w-[1px] h-full bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent via-[var(--text)]/10 to-transparent\"></div>\n        <div class=\"w-[1px] h-full bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent via-[var(--text)]/10 to-transparent\"></div>\n        <div class=\"w-[1px] h-full bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent via-[var(--text)]/10 to-transparent hidden md:block\"></div>\n        <div class=\"w-[1px] h-full bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent via-[var(--text)]/10 to-transparent\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- WebGL Particle Matrix Laser Canvas -->\n    <canvas id=\"laser-canvas\" class=\"fixed inset-0 w-full h-full pointer-events-none z-0\"></canvas>\n\n    <!-- Soft Grain Overlay -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none opacity-[0.06] mix-blend-overlay\"\n         style=\"background-image: radial-gradient(rgba(244,240,232,0.35) 0.5px, transparent 0.5px); background-size: 3px 3px;\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Floating Navigation Shell -->\n    <nav class=\"nav-reveal fixed top-8 left-1/2 z-50 w-auto\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center p-1 bg-[var(--surface)]/72 backdrop-blur-xl rounded-2xl border border-[var(--line)] nav-shell\">\n\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 text-[var(--text)] hover:text-[var(--signal)] transition-colors group border-r border-white/5 mr-1\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:command-bold-duotone\" class=\"text-lg transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-110\"></iconify-icon>\n                <span class=\"font-mono-custom text-xs font-medium tracking-widest\">Nexus</span>\n            </a>\n\n            <div class=\"hidden sm:flex items-center gap-1 px-2\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"font-mono-custom px-3 py-2 text-xs font-medium tracking-widest text-[var(--signal)] bg-[var(--signal)]/10 rounded-xl border border-[var(--signal)]/20 transition-all\">\n                    Platform\n                </a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"font-mono-custom px-3 py-2 text-xs font-medium tracking-widest text-[var(--muted)] hover:text-[var(--text)] hover:bg-white/5 rounded-xl transition-all\">\n                    Architecture\n                </a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"font-mono-custom px-3 py-2 text-xs font-medium tracking-widest text-[var(--muted)] hover:text-[var(--text)] hover:bg-white/5 rounded-xl transition-all\">\n                    Metrics\n                </a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"font-mono-custom px-3 py-2 text-xs font-medium tracking-widest text-[var(--muted)] hover:text-[var(--text)] hover:bg-white/5 rounded-xl transition-all\">\n                    Logs\n                </a>\n            </div>\n\n            <button class=\"sm:hidden px-3 py-2 text-[var(--muted)] hover:text-[var(--text)] transition-colors\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:hamburger-menu-bold-duotone\" class=\"text-xl\"></iconify-icon>\n            </button>\n        </div>\n    </nav>\n\n    <!-- Hero Content -->\n    <main class=\"relative z-10 grid grid-cols-1 place-items-center min-h-screen px-4 pt-32 pb-20 text-center\">\n\n        <div class=\"relative max-w-4xl flex flex-col items-center gap-8\">\n            <div class=\"hero-aura\"></div>\n\n            <h1 id=\"hero-title\" class=\"relative text-5xl sm:text-7xl md:text-8xl font-medium tracking-[-0.075em] leading-[0.94] text-[var(--text)]\">\n                <span class=\"headline-mask\">\n                    <span class=\"headline-line\">Semantic discovery</span>\n                </span>\n                <span class=\"headline-mask\">\n                    <span class=\"headline-line text-gradient\">powered by intent</span>\n                </span>\n            </h1>\n\n            <p class=\"hero-copy font-mono-custom text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.18em] leading-5 text-[var(--muted)] max-w-lg uppercase\">\n                Embed ultra-fast, context-aware search into your architecture with our laser-focused semantic API.\n            </p>\n\n            <!-- Gradient Border Shell Button -->\n            <div class=\"hero-cta mt-8 inline-block p-[1px] rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-[var(--signal)]/70 via-[var(--cyan)]/35 to-[var(--ember)]/45 shadow-[0_20px_45px_-18px_rgba(116,231,224,0.35)]\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"group relative flex items-center justify-center gap-3 min-w-[240px] px-6 py-4 rounded-[calc(1rem-1px)] bg-[var(--surface)]/95 overflow-hidden transition-colors border border-white/[0.03]\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[var(--signal)]/8 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500\"></div>\n                    <span class=\"font-mono-custom relative z-10 text-xs font-medium tracking-widest text-[var(--text)]\">Initialize System</span>\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-bold-duotone\" class=\"relative z-10 text-[var(--signal)] text-lg transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:translate-x-1\"></iconify-icon>\n                </a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n    </main>\n\n    <script>\n        // Premium headline reveal\n        window.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n            const reduceMotion = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;\n            if (reduceMotion) return;\n\n            const ease = 'cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1)';\n            const headlineLines = document.querySelectorAll('.headline-line');\n            const heroItems = document.querySelectorAll('.hero-copy, .hero-cta');\n            const nav = document.querySelector('.nav-reveal');\n\n            headlineLines.forEach((line, index) => {\n                line.animate(\n                    [\n                        { transform: 'translateY(118%) rotate(1.2deg)' },\n                        { transform: 'translateY(0%) rotate(0deg)' }\n                    ],\n                    {\n                        duration: 1200,\n                        delay: 140 + index * 145,\n                        easing: ease,\n                        fill: 'forwards'\n                    }\n                );\n            });\n\n            heroItems.forEach((item, index) => {\n                item.animate(\n                    [\n                        { opacity: 0, transform: 'translateY(14px)' },\n                        { opacity: 1, transform: 'translateY(0px)' }\n                    ],\n                    {\n                        duration: 850,\n                        delay: 520 + index * 95,\n                        easing: ease,\n                        fill: 'forwards'\n                    }\n                );\n            });\n\n            if (nav) {\n                nav.animate(\n                    [\n                        { opacity: 0, transform: 'translateX(-50%) translateY(14px)' },\n                        { opacity: 1, transform: 'translateX(-50%) translateY(0px)' }\n                    ],\n                    {\n                        duration: 850,\n                        delay: 480,\n                        easing: ease,\n                        fill: 'forwards'\n                    }\n                );\n            }\n        });\n\n        const canvas = document.getElementById('laser-canvas');\n        const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d', { alpha: false });\n        let width, height;\n\n        const spacing = 6;\n        const dotSize = 1.5;\n        let time = 0;\n        let mouseX = 0;\n        let mouseY = 0;\n\n        function resize() {\n            const ratio = Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio || 1, 1.35);\n            width = canvas.width = Math.floor(window.innerWidth * ratio);\n            height = canvas.height = Math.floor(window.innerHeight * ratio);\n            canvas.style.width = window.innerWidth + 'px';\n            canvas.style.height = window.innerHeight + 'px';\n\n            if (mouseX === 0) {\n                mouseX = width / 2;\n                mouseY = height / 2;\n            }\n        }\n\n        window.addEventListener('resize', resize);\n        window.addEventListener('mousemove', (e) => {\n            const ratio = Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio || 1, 1.35);\n            mouseX = e.clientX * ratio;\n            mouseY = e.clientY * ratio;\n        });\n        resize();\n\n        function draw() {\n            // Dark foundation with motion trail accumulation\n            ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(5, 6, 8, 0.42)';\n            ctx.fillRect(0, 0, width, height);\n\n            time += 0.008;\n\n            // Pointer drift calculation\n            const targetY = height * 0.45 + ((mouseY - height / 2) * 0.12);\n\n            ctx.globalCompositeOperation = 'lighter';\n\n            // Sweeping Dithered Laser logic\n            for (let x = 0; x < width; x += spacing) {\n\n                const wave = Math.sin(x * 0.002 - time * 1.5) * 40;\n                const curveY = targetY + wave;\n                const pulse = Math.sin(x * 0.004 + time * 4);\n\n                const startY = Math.max(0, curveY - 150);\n                const endY = Math.min(height, curveY + 150);\n\n                for (let y = startY; y < endY; y += spacing) {\n                    const distanceToCore = Math.abs(y - curveY);\n\n                    const thickness = 90 + (pulse * 25);\n\n                    if (distanceToCore < thickness) {\n                        // Sharp falloff creates narrow laser core and soft halo\n                        let intensity = Math.pow(1 - (distanceToCore / thickness), 2.5);\n\n                        // Coarse pixel / dither noise overlay\n                        const dither = (Math.sin(x * 0.8) * Math.cos(y * 0.8)) * 0.15;\n                        intensity += dither;\n\n                        if (intensity > 0.02) {\n                            // Updated palette: glacial cyan + electric signal + warm ember\n                            const colorShift = Math.sin((x / width) * Math.PI * 2 + time * 0.8) * 0.5 + 0.5;\n\n                            const cyan = { r: 116, g: 231, b: 224 };\n                            const signal = { r: 231, g: 255, b: 114 };\n                            const ember = { r: 255, g: 135, b: 100 };\n\n                            let r = (cyan.r * (1 - colorShift) + signal.r * colorShift) * intensity;\n                            let g = (cyan.g * (1 - colorShift) + signal.g * colorShift) * intensity;\n                            let b = (cyan.b * (1 - colorShift) + signal.b * colorShift) * intensity;\n\n                            const emberMix = Math.max(0, Math.sin(time * 0.7 + y * 0.006)) * 0.16;\n                            r = r * (1 - emberMix) + ember.r * intensity * emberMix;\n                            g = g * (1 - emberMix) + ember.g * intensity * emberMix;\n                            b = b * (1 - emberMix) + ember.b * intensity * emberMix;\n\n                            // Luminous restraint: core turns soft white\n                            if (intensity > 0.65) {\n                                const coreBoost = (intensity - 0.65) * 3.5;\n                                r = Math.min(255, r + 244 * coreBoost);\n                                g = Math.min(255, g + 240 * coreBoost);\n                                b = Math.min(255, b + 232 * coreBoost);\n                            }\n\n                            ctx.fillStyle = `rgb(${Math.floor(r)}, ${Math.floor(g)}, ${Math.floor(b)})`;\n                            ctx.fillRect(x, y, dotSize, dotSize);\n                        }\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n\n            ctx.globalCompositeOperation = 'source-over';\n            requestAnimationFrame(draw);\n        }\n\n        draw();\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "nexus-semantic-search.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/staff-featured-2026-05-22/nexus-semantic-search.jpg", "source_name": "nexus-semantic-search-DESIGN.md", "views": 50, "forks": 1, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "66a84ecf-0972-40f3-8a4c-15b11d3aee0a", "created_at": "2026-06-21T11:39:54.279152+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-04T00:07:57.587364+00:00"}